            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AJsMama"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made a few changes - \nI left out the parsley since I didn't have any on hand. I only used a 10oz box of frozen spinach, and shredded an extra 1/4C of cheese to sprinkle on top. Also, I've started making this dip with light mayo, light sour cream &amp; 1/3 less fat cream cheese - still tastes just as good (but is better for you!). This has become my go-to hot dip recipe for any gathering. So yummy."
          },
          {
