            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jason"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I got many rave reviews about this dip. Great texture and taste. Also, really easy to make. I just mixed the ingredients in a small crock pot, put in on about 2 hours beforehand, and it was ready for guests. I changed the amount of parsley. I only added about 2 tablespoons, as the spinach was enough on the flavor and greenery. Also, I added about a cup of corn to the mix to give it a little extra color.",
            "datePublished": "2015-12-25T12:16:53.693Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jennifer berkley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wow! Amazing! I added a bit more sour cream and mayo (about 1/4 cup each) and that made it very creamy rather than stiff. So good! Was generous with the garlic, and also sprinkled a little more asiago on top before baking. I'm a cheese lover so it makes me happy but not necessary. It's 10:30 at night and I'm still dipping into it!",
            "datePublished": "2017-01-10T03:29:06.327Z"
          },
          {
