              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DEBK68"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made it twice, the first in the oven, kind of dry. Then I made again with 1/2 cup more asiago and put it in the fondue pot. It was GREAT!",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-10T16:36:06.367Z"
